<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "published": true,
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2025-10-20T22:10:15.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18605,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "###BEHIND THE SCENES\n\nHow does AI create an image from your prompt?\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8b6420bcb71cdfde2997b6575a7034c8-behind the scene.gif",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-e349bed8-89d6-4efc-8a0e-29b8a1e5afb1",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "text": "This AI learned by taking clear pictures and adding random color splotches until they looked like a mess.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/9a1d25b5aa76b3a6c9b4e0fabdd11b21-scan.gif",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-93102ee9-aa96-4429-aafb-52f8fe7fd787",
        "layout": "text-top-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "By “messing up” lots of pictures, it learned how to clean them back up.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5744367bcf7b79063f715cc930c1ad54-noise1.jpg",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-35731f8b-92f2-4309-954a-d8481cc58b14",
        "layout": "text-top-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "To create a new image, the AI starts with pure noise, like completely random paint splotches.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/5744367bcf7b79063f715cc930c1ad54-noise1.jpg",
        "key": "HoAI_pilot_5_dancer_info-0ae6fab6-0f3d-4751-bd68-31f5bc186f74"
      },
      {
        "text": "\nLittle by little, it removes the noise until a picture appears that matches your prompt.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f99ba1c8919dd4a405883ba98572f77b-noise2.jpg",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info-07287924-c7c1-45c4-86e6-1dc2621827a0",
        "layout": "text-top-center",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Always check what AI created. \n\n**You decide whether to keep it or try again!**",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/79ff55ecdac0d730326619f20bc83d81-panel 6.jpg",
        "key": "Generate_dancer_info_2-571b0646-acfe-4ce0-804b-d73443dba600",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "name_suffix": "_7"
  },
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20T22:10:15.158+00:00\",\"changed\":[\"cloned from \\\"HoAI_pilot_6_dancer_info\\\"\"],\"cloned_from\":\"HoAI_pilot_6_dancer_info\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20 22:21:42 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":18605,\"changed_by_email\":\"katie.frank+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2025-10-20 22:22:22 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":18605,\"changed_by_email\":\"katie.frank+levelbuilder@code.org\"}]"
}]]></config>
</Panels>
